    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spaceship crash-landed in some kind of alien jungle, and you barely made it out using your escape pod. Now, you'll have to cross the jungle to find a city where you can hopefully launch yourself back into space and find your way home again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by your escape pod AI, you'll traverse 33 unique levels and face 3 epic bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a block breaker you can play alone or with a friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player or 2-player local co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different episode with a total of 33 levels and 3 boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging story that has absolutely nothing more to it. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're definitely not helping an alien fleet conquer and enslave the galaxy.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spaceship crash-landed in some kind of alien jungle, and you barely made it out using your escape pod. Now, you'll have to cross the jungle to find a city where you can hopefully launch yourself back into space and find your way home again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by your escape pod AI, you'll traverse 33 unique levels and face 3 epic bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a block breaker you can play alone or with a friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player or 2-player local co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different episode with a total of 33 levels and 3 boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging story that has absolutely nothing more to it. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're definitely not helping an alien fleet conquer and enslave the galaxy.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You're playing an innocent block breaker game. It's like Pong combined with Arkanoid. It's definitely not hiding some deeper, nefarious purpose. Come play! It's perfectly safe!",
